WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.140
Okay, Drew, as you step out on the balcony

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.360
and you look across all

3
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:06.410
that you've built thus far at Brief,

4
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.070
what are you most proud of?

5
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.460
Every new feature has a moment

6
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.720
where we dark launch

7
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.970
it and we are the only users of it.

8
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.860
And like, it's funny building an agent

9
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.580
that gives advice

10
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.750
