20
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.700
And I think as each part of the product

21
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.950
hits that inflection point of,

22
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.170
hey, this is actually really good advice.

23
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:45.860
I'm like, actually,

24
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:47.180
this is something I wouldn't have even known

25
00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.030
because I don't go scan all of our competitors'

26
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.850
